    "description": "\ud83d\ude80 <b>Solitaire Game x Rescue Story Episode</b> \ud83d\udca5\r\n\r\nAll-new Classic Solitaire card game, enriched with thrilling story episodes! \ud83d\udc7b\r\n\r\nHURRY UP! \ud83d\ude31 The fate of the rescue mission lies in your hands! Your friends in Solitaire Story are counting on your aid! \ud83c\udfc3\u200d\u2642\ufe0f\r\n\r\n\ud83c\udd98\u2705 <b>Your Rescue Mission is Clear:</b>\r\n\r\n\u2460 Train your brain and conquer Solitaire card game.\r\n\u2461 Win card deals to help your friends in the storyline.\r\n\u2462 Fix problems, mend broken story situations.\r\n\u2463 Let your warm-heartedness shine as you restore harmony!\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udd2e <b>Follow the storyline and get ready to face a series of intriguing stories:</b>\r\n\r\nFrom a struggling family \ud83d\ude2d and heartbroken lady \ud83d\udc94 to a lonely tiger \ud83d\udc2f, thirsty fish \ud83d\udc1f, and endangered animals \ud83d\udc3c... and so on \ud83d\udc7d\r\nThey're all desperately counting on YOUR HELP! \ud83d\udca1\r\n\r\n\ud83e\udde9 <b>Game's Highlights</b>\r\n\r\n\u2663 Classic Solitaire card game\r\n\u2663 Follow the fun stories\r\n\u2663 Easy but addictive game\r\n\u2663 Unlock new story episodes\r\n\u2663 100% free to play game\r\n\u2663 Sharpen your brain and find joy.\r\n\u2663 Perfect time killer and IQ boost.\r\n\u2663 Exciting challenge & events\r\n\u2663 Customizable card themes\r\n\u2663 Customizable backgrounds\r\n\u2663 Unlimited free undo\r\n\u2663 Crisp and easy-to-read cards\r\n\u2663 1-card or 3-card flip mode\r\n\u2663 Playable online and offline\r\n\u2663 No internet, no wifi required\r\n\u2663 Both online and offline playable.\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udcec Contact Solitaire Story support team at: SolitaireStory@linkdesks.com \r\n\r\nWait no more! \ud83d\udd25 Roll up your sleeves and start the Solitaire Story rescue mission! \ud83e\udd38\u200d\u2640\ufe0f",
